ing I tried to show him I  was serious but this happened he hit you  the operative asked the policeman simply  shook his head no I I don't know how he  does it I hate him the man was released  into the custody of the SCP Foundation  and officially designated  scp-073  scp-073 is a man of Middle Eastern  descent standing at six foot one inches  tall with black hair and blue eyes he  appears to be in his early 30s but  Research indicates that he is much older  than that he looks like an average man  with a few noticeable exceptions his  arms legs spinal cord and shoulder  blades have been replaced with metal of  some kind when asked about these metal  additions the subject seems surprised  and insists that he has no memory of  when when or why the alterations were  made he has a symbol carved into his  forehead which has not yet been  translated though it seems to be  Sumerian in origin the subject is aware  of the symbol's presence but does not  like to discuss it at all he becomes  distressed whenever it is brought up and  refuses to explain  scp-073 has the needs of an ordinary  human being and requires regular  consumption of meals as well as plenty  of water he subsists on a strictly  animal-based diet of various meats and  cheeses which are provided for him on  demand he refers to himself as Kane and  is generally friendly and polite to  everyone he interacts with if a bit  formal and stiff he is extremely helpful  and has volunteered to help out with  various tasks around the foundation site  from cleaning and general maintenance to  assisting in research he prefers to  provide assistance on the research side  of things largely due to his  photographic memory wide knowledge of  world history and fluency in most of the  world's common spoken languages when he  was first brought into Foundation  custody he provided evidence of these  skills via a placement test in French  German English Japanese Mandarin Italian  and a dozen other languages a trivia  contest wher