d  his sandwich and several chapters of the  book he was reading on his break as he  passed scp-073 who was enjoying a meal  of his own Dr buyer tripped and Spilled  his scalding hot soup all over the man's  back before he could react he fell to  his knees in pain as blisters and burns  erupted across his own back Kane jumped  up from the table with a surprised yell  but his skin remained unblemished Dr  Byer on the other hand had to spend the  rest of his lunch break in the medical  wing and never got to finish that soup  Kane is permitted to interact with other  scps as long as an erection between the  two is not considered dangerous for one  or more parties involved he has not  expressed much interest in other scps  with the exception of the few that are  permitted to roam the facility as they  please for example he has engaged in  some polite small talk with scp-507 and  always gives a friendly pat on the head  to scp-999 whenever he bumps into it  there is one SCP however that Kane has  specifically requested he never be in a  room with  scp-076 also known as able though he has  kept his personal knowledge of  scp-076 to himself Kane has admitted  that he knows everything about the man  he would not elaborate further and  simply said that it would be better for  everyone involved if the two never met  no one knows for certain what would  happen if those two superhumans came  face to face but if someone as powerful  as Kane is afraid of the consequences it  certainly cannot be good now go check  out scp-073 and scp-076 Kane vs Abel and  scp-6008 Noah's Ark for more epic  anomalies

